<div class="sc-host"><div style="font-family: Manrope, -apple-system, sans-serif; color: rgb(17, 17, 17);"> <div id="1a"> <div style="position: sticky; top: 0px; z-index: 900;"> <div style="background: rgb(110, 103, 94); color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: center; padding: 13px 24px; font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14.5px; letter-spacing: 0.01em;"> Livraison GRATUITE partout en France <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 0px 18px;">·</span> Retours faciles sous 30 jours <span style="display: inline-block; padding: 0px 18px;">·</span> 12 000+ clients nous font confiance </div> <header style="background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(239, 234, 226);"> <div style="max-width: 1320px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 20px 40px 0px; text-align: center;"> <a href="/" style="display: inline-block;"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="{{ 'IMG_4614.jpeg' | asset_url }}" alt="LÈANE Paris" style="height: 70px; width: auto; display: block;"></a> </div> <div style="max-width: 1320px; margin: 0px auto; padding: 18px 40px 30px; position: relative; display: flex; justify-content: center; align-items: center;"> <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px; width: 100%;"> <nav style="display: flex; gap: 42px; font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12.5px; letter-spacing: 0.13em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(74, 74, 74);"> <a href="/" class="scp0" style="color: rgb(74, 74, 74); transition: color 0.2s;">Accueil</a> <a href="/pages/about-us" class="scp0" style="color: rgb(74, 74, 74); transition: color 0.2s;">À propos</a> <a href="/pages/contact" class="scp0" style="color: rgb(74, 74, 74); transition: color 0.2s;">Contact</a> <a href="/pages/tracking" class="scp0" style="color: rgb(74, 74, 74); transition: color 0.2s;">Suivi de commande</a> </nav> <nav style="display: flex; gap: 36px; font-family: Manrope; font-weight: 600; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: up